cells:
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "## Problem 1-4 : NorthWinddatset
      https://relational.fit.cvut.cz/dataset/Northwind\r

      \r

      How to download the dataset\r

      \r

      To download the dataset you need to create connection in your mysql
      workbench \r

      \r

      The datasets are publicly available directly from MariaDB database.\r

      \r

      * Open your favourite MariaDB client (MySQL Workbench)\r

      Use following credentials:\r

      ```\r

      \    hostname: relational.fit.cvut.cz\r

      \    port: 3306\r

      \    username: guest\r

      \    password: relational\r

      ```\r

      Drive link:
      https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FMi6g1KDHbn17ikJSi7bE9-THywlxhdu?\
      usp=sharing"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "###`Q-1`: Rank Employee in terms of revenue generation. Show employee
